<p>This week, <a href="https://www.relay.fm/mpu/847">Stephen and I made an episode about AI</a>. <em>I know.</em> We tried to just talk about what&#8217;s working for each of us right now. We get into dictation, AI browsers, MCP, what Apple Intelligence might become, and the smaller weirder projects we each have running. </p>



<p>Stephen wrote an app that finds you good coffee. I wrote an app that helps you say no to things. Both made it into the App Store, somehow. My robot is now resetting Field Guide enrollments while I do something more interesting. It also picks my outfits, and my wife noticed before I told her. I&#8217;m calling that one a win.</p>



